      "writtenOn": "2024-06-26T03:40:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just added an equality check for Object.class to avoid iterating the array for such methods. This should be a bit less expensive than isAssignableFrom, which needs to walk through the whole linked list of parent classes before it can return false. This code may be called many times for app-defined objects that have many methods.\nParcelable is an interface so getDeclaringClass should return the class that implements the interface in that case.\n\nRegarding using getDeclaredMethods: we can\u0027t because if A overrides B that overrides NetworkCallback, A.getDeclaredMethods would miss methods overridden by B. Added a comment.",
      "parentUuid": "f7083437_b3f2a320",
